#tr.en: total: 4 shekels oil; total: 4 shekels alkali-plant; 
6. szunigin 2(disz) sa szum2 
#tr.en: total: 2 bundles onions; 
7. u4 1(u) 8(disz)-kam 
#tr.en: 18th day, 
# some text moved to next line 
