#tr.en: for 2 days to Nagsu barge punted, barge unloaded, and to the quay barge floated; 
11. 7(disz) gurusz u4 1(disz)-sze3 
#tr.en: 7 male laborer workdays, 
12. umma{ki#}-ta me-en-kar2-sze3 ma2 gid2-da 
