# if plough type1 . plough type2, then:
# d = 2(a ÷ b/3) + (a ÷ c/3 x 3/2/1) etc.
4. 1(bur3) GAN2 tug2-gurx(|SZE.KIN|) 1/2(iku) 1/4(iku) GAN2-ta x a-ra2 3(disz) 4(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2-ta 
