&P235733 = Erlangen 2 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. 1(bur3) GAN2 tug2-gurx(|SZE.KIN|) tug2-gur8 1/2(iku) 1/4(iku) GAN2-ta gesz a-ra2 3(disz@t) 4(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2-ta 
2. a2 erin2-na-bi u4 3(gesz2) 
# calculation: ((18 × 3[erin2/plough]) ÷ 3/4) + ((18 × 3 x 3) ÷ 4 1/2) = 72 + 36 = 108 (text: 180) 
3. 3(bur3) GAN2 tug2-gurx(|SZE.KIN|) 1/2(iku) 1/4(iku) GAN2-ta gesz a-ra2 3(disz@t) 4(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2-ta 
4. a2 erin2-na-bi u4 5(gesz2) 2(u) 4(disz)-kam 
# calculation: ((54 × 3) ÷ 3/4) + ((54 × 3 x 3) ÷ 4 1/2) = 216 + 108 = 324 
# ploughmen always 3 erin2, seeding ploughs always 4 erin2: 
# d = (a ÷ b/3) + (a ÷ c/3 x 3/2/1) = (a/b x 3) + ((a/c x 3) x 3/2/1)
# if plough type1 . plough type2, then:
# d = 2(a ÷ b/3) + (a ÷ c/3 x 3/2/1) etc.
5. 7(bur3) 1(esze3) GAN2 gesz-ur3-ra a-ra2 4(disz) 4(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2-ta 
6. a2 erin2-na-bi u4 5(gesz2) 5(u) 2(disz)-kam 
# calculation: (132 × 3 x 4) ÷ 4 1/2 = 352 
7. 7(bur3) 1(iku) GAN2 gesz-ur3-ra a-ra2 3(disz@t) 4(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2-ta 
@reverse 
1. a2 erin2-na-bi u4 4(gesz2) 1(u) 4(disz)-kam 
# calculation: (127 × 3 x 3) ÷ 4 1/2 = 254 
2. GAN2-gu4 
3. 2(esze3) GAN2 gesz a-ra2 3(disz@t) 4(iku) 1/2(iku)? GAN2-ta 
4. a2 erin2-na-bi u4 2(u) 4(disz)-kam 
# calculation: (12 × 3 x 3) ÷ 4 1/2 = 24 
5. szuku engar 
6. 4(iku) GAN2 tug2-gur8 1/2(iku) 1/4(iku) GAN2 gesz-ur3-ra? a-ra2 3(disz@t) 4(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2 
# text moved to next line 
7. a2 erin2-na-bi u4 4(u) 2(disz) ki-szum2-ma 
# calculation: ((4 × 3) ÷ 3/4) + ((4 × 3 x 3) ÷ 4 1/2) = 16 + 8 = 24 (text: 42) 
8. a-sza3 gi-kin-ak 
9. a-sza3 ka-ma-ri2{ki} 
10. ugula ur-lugal 
11. kiszib3 lu2-{d}szara2 dumu ur-{gesz}gigir 
12. mu {d}szu-{d}suen lugal-e na-ru2-a-mah {d}en-lil2 {d}nin-lil2-ra mu-ne-du3 
@seal 1 
1. lu2-{d}szara2 
2. dub-sar 
3. dumu ur-{gesz}gigir 
 
 

