&P273413 = CDLJ 2006/2, no. 05 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. 1(disz) kasz dida 5(disz) sila3 kasz saga 
#tr.en: 1 pot (ca. 10 liters) of dida beer, 5 sila3 (1 sila3 ca. 1 liter) of high-quality beer, 
